{"id":822,"name":"Fuuka","slug":"fuuka","synopsis":"The story centers on a young man named Yuu Haruna who has just switched schools. He's a bit shy, and he's constantly glued to his smartphone so he can check Twitter. He meets a girl named Fuuka Akitsuki, who doesn't even have a cell phone, is free-spirited, and naturally fascinates others. Yuu recently has been getting back in touch via Twitter with his childhood friend Koyuki Hinashi, who is now a popular singer. One day Yuu invites Fuuka to one of Koyuki's concerts, and there the three meet for the first time. The story follows the love triangle between a love that started through electronics, and a love that didn't start through electronics.\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)","format":"TV","season":"WINTER","year":2017,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:46","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 02:07:13","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":33743},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":21887},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":12460},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":12300},{"site":"ANN","externalId":18879},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":8026},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":1639,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/wAmZNQfbiOuE7vYOYjQj3swmuF6liahFfNK0Rs96.jpg"},{"id":1640,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/8kJWsMu5towYyrkyqLckvhbJIXe0Bq7RbRHpNmlX.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":27,"name":"Diomedéa","slug":"diomedea"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":7840,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":7841,"title":"Climber's High!","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":9190,"version":1,"episodes":"1-4","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":8624,"basename":"Fuuka-OP1.webm","filename":"Fuuka-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/Fuuka-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":27487339,"resolution":720,"nc":false,"subbed":false,"lyrics":false,"overlap":"NONE